# The White Kitten: Lil Timmy in Stormwind for the Alliance, Xaphod Bizznox at
# Malaka'jin in Stonetalon Mountains for the Horde (new in Forever).
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (both vendors; Lil Timmy's spawn point;
# Xaphod Bizznox 262471, Horde, at the Darkspear camp of Malaka'jin, from
# Forever's quest-addon and item-page data); the TDB's vendor row for Lil
# Timmy (one kitten in stock, restocked every 2.5 hours; Classic data);
# Forever's client data 1.60.1.70532 (ItemSparse price: 60s; every pet item
# teaches its companion when used).
# ASSUMED: Lil Timmy carries one kitten at a time and walks a set path from
# Cathedral Square, as in Classic (Classic flow; beta players report the same
# path and the single kitten; the restock time is Classic data). In-game
# check: how long until he has a kitten again.
# Xaphod Bizznox keeps one kitten at a time too: the EG Link vendor scans
# (builds 1.60.1.70009 to 70790) list it as limited, at most 1 in stock, and a
# player's merchant window at Malaka'jin showed 1 left (recordings, #1348 sweep).

step Lil Timmy
  only Alliance
  tip Lil Timmy sells the White Kitten (60s). He starts at Cathedral Square and walks through the Trade District, Old Town and the Dwarven District before he vanishes near the square again; if he is not around, wait for him at Cathedral Square. By beta reports he carries one kitten at a time: if he has none, someone just bought it. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goal stays ticked afterwards.
  vendor 8666                         -- Lil Timmy
  buy 8489 npc 8666 optional          -- Cat Carrier (White Kitten), 60s

step Xaphod Bizznox
  only Horde
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Horde players buy the White Kitten (60s) from Xaphod Bizznox, a trader new in Forever, at Malaka'jin, the Darkspear camp at the southern tip of Stonetalon Mountains, on the way up from the Barrens. He keeps one kitten at a time: if he has none, someone just bought it. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goal stays ticked afterwards.
  vendor 262471                       -- Xaphod Bizznox
  buy 8489 npc 262471 optional        -- Cat Carrier (White Kitten), 60s
